        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .hn-legal-rules, .hn-legal-rules * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .hn-legal-rules { background:#fff; color:#101010; font-family:inherit; padding:clamp(42px,5vw,76px) 24px 92px; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__wrap { max-width:800px; margin:0 auto; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__head { text-align:left; margin-bottom:30px; padding-bottom:30px; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__eyebrow { color:#626266; font-size:10px; font-weight:750; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; line-height:1.6; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__title { color:#101010; font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,48px); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.048em; line-height:1.09; margin:15px 0 16px; max-width:680px; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__title span { color:#101010; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__deck { color:#626266; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; margin:0; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__notice { padding:17px 21px; border-left:3px solid #ffa300; background:#fff8e9; border-radius:0 8px 8px 0; font-size:14px; font-weight:800; line-height:1.55; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body { margin-top:12px; background:#fff; border:0; border-radius:0; padding:0; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body section { padding:27px 0 29px; margin:0; border-bottom:1px solid #ededed; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body section:last-child { border-bottom:0; margin-bottom:0; padding-bottom:0; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body h2 { color:#101010; font-size:20px; font-weight:800; line-height:1.35; letter-spacing:-.025em; margin:0 0 12px; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body h3 { color:#101010; font-size:15px; font-weight:800; margin:22px 0 9px; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body p, .hn-legal-rules__body li { color:#414141; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body p { margin:0 0 12px; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body p:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body ul { padding-left:21px; margin:10px 0 16px; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body li { padding-left:4px; margin-bottom:5px; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body li::marker { color:#ffa300; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body a { color:#9a5d00; text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:3px; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__body strong { color:#101010; font-weight:800; }\n  .hn-legal-rules__contact { margin-top:24px; padding:20px 22px; background:#f6f6f6; border-radius:10px; }\n  @media(max-width:749px) {\n    .hn-legal-rules { padding:34px 19px 55px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__head { margin-bottom:23px; padding-bottom:23px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__eyebrow { font-size:9px; letter-spacing:.11em; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__title { font-size:clamp(30px,8vw,38px); line-height:1.1; margin:12px 0 13px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__deck { font-size:12px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__notice { font-size:12px; padding:14px 15px; line-height:1.5; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__body { margin-top:5px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__body section { padding:22px 0 23px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__body h2 { font-size:18px; margin-bottom:10px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__body h3 { font-size:14px; margin:19px 0 8px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__body p, .hn-legal-rules__body li { font-size:13px; line-height:1.65; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__body p { margin-bottom:11px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__body ul { padding-left:19px; margin:9px 0 14px; }\n    .hn-legal-rules__contact { padding:16px; border-radius:8px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"hn-legal-rules\" aria-labelledby=\"hn-legal-rules-title\">\n  <div class=\"hn-legal-rules__wrap\">\n    <header class=\"hn-legal-rules__head\">\n      <div class=\"hn-legal-rules__eyebrow\">HNDRD NITRIX 80 BULLET ULTIMATE GIVEAWAY</div>\n      <h1 class=\"hn-legal-rules__title\" id=\"hn-legal-rules-title\">OFFICIAL <span>SWEEPSTAKES RULES.</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"hn-legal-rules__deck\">November 1–30, 2026</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"hn-legal-rules__notice\">NO PURCHASE NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN. A PURCHASE WILL NOT INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING.</div>\n\n    <div class=\"hn-legal-rules__body\">\n      <section>\n        <h2>1. Sponsor</h2>\n        <p>The HNDRD NITRIX 80 BULLET Ultimate Giveaway (\"Sweepstakes\") is sponsored by Sunlight Sports US LLC - Aurora IL 60502 (\"Sponsor\").</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>2. Sweepstakes Period</h2>\n        <p>The Sweepstakes begins on <strong>November 1, 2026, at 12:00 AM Pacific Time</strong> and ends on <strong>November 30, 2026, at 11:59 PM Pacific Time</strong> (\"Sweepstakes Period\").</p>\n        <p>All entries must be received during the Sweepstakes Period to be eligible.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>3. Eligibility</h2>\n        <p>The Sweepstakes is open to legal residents of the 50 United States regardless of age, subject to the following requirements:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Participants ages 18 and older may enter on their own behalf.</li>\n          <li>Participants under 18 must have a parent or legal guardian complete and submit the entry on their behalf using the parent or legal guardian's contact information.</li>\n          <li>If a minor is selected as a potential winner, their parent or legal guardian must verify eligibility, complete any required documentation, and accept the prize on the minor's behalf.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Employees of the Sponsor, its affiliates, individuals directly involved in administering the Sweepstakes, and their immediate family or household members are not eligible.</p>\n        <p>Void where prohibited by law.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>4. How to Enter</h2>\n        <p>Eligible participants may enter the Sweepstakes during November 1–30, 2026, through the official HNDRD giveaway form:</p>\n        <p><a href=\"https://forms.gle/vUTcGrcT1Ri7NH5S9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://forms.gle/vUTcGrcT1Ri7NH5S9</a></p>\n        <h3>A. Free Standard Entry</h3>\n        <p>Participants may receive two (2) entries per day by completing and submitting the official giveaway form during the Sweepstakes Period (November 1–30, 2026).</p>\n        <p>Participants who successfully complete and submit the form once every day for all 30 days will receive an additional forty (40) bonus entries.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Daily Entry: Two (2) entries per day</li>\n          <li>Maximum Daily Entries: Sixty (60) entries over 30 days</li>\n          <li>Completion Bonus: Forty (40) additional entries</li>\n          <li>Maximum Total: One Hundred (100) entries</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Only one standard entry submission per participant per calendar day will be counted.</p>\n        <p>No purchase, Instagram account, or ownership of HNDRD equipment is required.</p>\n        <h3>B. Optional Promotional Activities</h3>\n        <p>HNDRD may offer additional promotional activities, subject to applicable laws and Instagram's promotion policies.</p>\n        <p>Proposed activities include:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Following @hndrd.us and liking the official giveaway post: Two (2) entries</li>\n          <li>Sharing a photo or video featuring HNDRD equipment and tagging @hndrd.us: Five (5) entries</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3>C. Qualifying Purchases</h3>\n        <p>Participants may submit receipts for qualifying purchases made during the Sweepstakes Period through authorized U.S. HNDRD retailers.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>HNDRD Strings:</strong> Five (5) entries per string set</li>\n          <li><strong>HNDRD Shoes:</strong> Twenty (20) entries per pair</li>\n          <li><strong>HNDRD Rackets:</strong> Twenty (20) entries per racket</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Bonus entries are awarded per qualifying item purchased, subject to the maximum limit of one hundred (100) total entries per participant.</p>\n        <p>Receipts must identify the purchase date, eligible products, and transaction details.</p>\n        <h3>D. Free Alternative Method of Entry</h3>\n        <p>Participants who do not make a purchase may obtain the same number of entries available through the purchase-associated entry schedule by using the free alternative method by completing the form per day.</p>\n        <h3>E. Maximum Entries</h3>\n        <p>Each eligible participant may receive a maximum of one hundred (100) entries during the Sweepstakes Period, regardless of entry method.</p>\n        <p>Entries exceeding the limit will not be counted.</p>\n        <h3>F. Verification</h3>\n        <p>Sponsor reserves the right to verify eligibility and compliance with these Official Rules.</p>\n        <p>Fraudulent, falsified, automated, or otherwise ineligible entries may be disqualified, subject to applicable law.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>5. Prizes</h2>\n        <p>Three (3) winners will each receive one (1) HNDRD NITRIX 80 BULLET Prize Package containing:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>One (1) HNDRD NITRIX 80 BULLET racket</li>\n          <li>One (1) HNDRD AERIS PACK KIT BAG</li>\n          <li>One (1) HNDRD Tournament T-shirt</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p><strong>Approximate Retail Value (ARV):</strong> $499 per prize package.</p>\n        <p><strong>Total Approximate Retail Value (ARV):</strong> $1,497.00</p>\n        <p>Product models, available racket specifications, and apparel sizes are subject to availability.</p>\n        <p>Prizes are nontransferable, are not redeemable for cash, and may not be exchanged except at the Sponsor's discretion. Sponsor reserves the right to substitute a prize of equal or greater value if necessary.</p>\n        <p>Each winner is responsible for any applicable taxes associated with receiving the prize.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>6. Winner Selection and Notification</h2>\n        <p>Three (3) potential winners will be selected through a random drawing from all eligible entries received during the Sweepstakes Period.</p>\n        <p>Limit one (1) prize package per participant during the Sweepstakes.</p>\n        <p>The drawing is expected to take place on or around December 1, 2026.</p>\n        <p>Potential winners will be notified using the email address or other contact information provided on the official entry form. Instagram direct messages may also be used when applicable.</p>\n        <p>Potential winners must respond within five (5) calendar days of notification.</p>\n        <p>If a potential winner does not respond within the specified period, fails to verify eligibility, or does not comply with these Official Rules, Sponsor may select an alternate winner through a random drawing.</p>\n        <p>A participant is not considered an official winner until eligibility has been verified and all required documentation has been completed.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>7. Odds of Winning</h2>\n        <p>The odds of winning depend on the total number of eligible entries received during the Sweepstakes Period.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>8. Prize Fulfillment</h2>\n        <p>Winners may be required to provide proof of eligibility and a valid shipping address within the United States.</p>\n        <p>For minor winners, a parent or legal guardian may be required to provide shipping information and complete any necessary documentation.</p>\n        <p>Prizes will be shipped at the Sponsor's expense within 10 business days following winner verification, subject to product availability and shipping conditions.</p>\n        <p>Sponsor is not responsible for delivery delays caused by shipping carriers or incorrect shipping information provided by winners, except as otherwise required by law.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>9. Publicity</h2>\n        <p>Where permitted by law, winners may be invited to participate in promotional announcements on HNDRD USA's website, Instagram, or other marketing channels.</p>\n        <p>Use of a winner's name, photograph, likeness, or social media content will be subject to applicable law and any required consent.</p>\n        <p>For minor winners, parental or legal guardian consent will be obtained where required.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>10. Instagram Disclaimer</h2>\n        <p>This Sweepstakes is not sponsored, endorsed, administered by, or associated with Instagram or Meta.</p>\n        <p>By entering, participants acknowledge that they are providing their information to the Sponsor and not Instagram.</p>\n        <p>Participants agree to comply with applicable Instagram platform rules when completing optional Instagram activities.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>11. General Conditions</h2>\n        <p>Sponsor reserves the right, subject to applicable law, to disqualify any participant who engages in fraud, manipulation, unauthorized automation, or other violations of these Official Rules.</p>\n        <p>Sponsor may suspend, modify, or cancel the Sweepstakes if fraud, technical failures, or other circumstances beyond its reasonable control compromise its fairness or integrity, subject to applicable law.</p>\n        <p>Any material changes to these Official Rules will be communicated through the official giveaway channels as required by law.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>12. Privacy</h2>\n        <p>Personal information collected in connection with the Sweepstakes will be used to administer the promotion, verify eligibility, contact potential winners, and fulfill prizes.</p>\n        <p>Information will be handled in accordance with the Sponsor's privacy policy.</p>\n        <p>Personal information collected from or concerning minors will be handled in accordance with applicable privacy and parental consent requirements.</p>\n        <p>Participation in the Sweepstakes does not automatically constitute consent to receive marketing communications. Any optional marketing subscription will be handled separately and in accordance with applicable law.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>13. Winner List</h2>\n        <p>To request the names of the Sweepstakes winners, please email <strong><a href=\"mailto:jessica.n@hndrd.co\">jessica.n@hndrd.co</a></strong> with the subject line \"HNDRD Sweepstakes Winner List\" by January 31, 2027.</p>\n        <p>Winner information will be provided in accordance with applicable laws and privacy requirements.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2>14. Governing Law</h2>\n        <p>The Sweepstakes is governed by the laws of the State of Illinois and applicable federal laws of the United States, without regard to conflict-of-law principles, except where otherwise required by applicable law.</p>\n        <p>Nothing in these Official Rules limits or waives any rights or protections afforded to participants under applicable federal or state laws.</p>\n        <div class=\"hn-legal-rules__contact\">\n          <p><strong>Sponsor Contact:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:jessica.n@hndrd.co\">jessica.n@hndrd.co</a></p>\n          <p>Aurora IL 60502</p>\n          <p><strong>Official Giveaway Period:</strong> November 1–30, 2026</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
